{"full":"hf:mayafree/Model-Genome-Korea","spaceId":"mayafree/Model-Genome-Korea","name":"Model Genome Korea","source":"huggingface","description":"DNA lineage test of Korean LLM & VLM foundation models","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"HTML","topics":["static","korean-llm","korean-ai","model-lineage","model-provenance","foundation-models","vlm","sovereign-ai","region:us"],"technologies":[],"likes":33,"created":"2026-08-08T10:07:46.000Z","updated":"2026-08-10T08:53:48.000Z","license":"apache-2.0","runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://mayafree-model-genome-korea.static.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/mayafree/Model-Genome-Korea","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T06:43:39.097Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T06:43:39.097Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T06:43:39.097Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🧬","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Model Genome Korea is a free, interactive tool that reveals the architectural lineage (\"DNA\") of every major Korean sovereign AI foundation model. It genotypes each Korean large language model (LLM) and vision-language model (VLM) — measured directly from public config.json files and model weights on Hugging Face — to show, objectively, which Korean AI models are built from scratch and which are derived from foreign open-weight bases like Qwen, Llama, or DeepSeek.","The tool covers foundation models from 9 Korean organizations that released self-developed foundation models on Hugging Face: LG AI Research (EXAONE), SKT (A.X), Upstage (SOLAR), NCSOFT (VARCO), NAVER (HyperCLOVA X), Kakao (Kanana), KT (Mi:dm), Motif Technologies (Motif), and VIDRAFT (AETHER) — spanning large enterprises, telcos, mid-size firms, and startups.","Model Genome Korea is an architecture-provenance explorer for Korean sovereign AI. Like a genetic paternity test for neural networks, it fingerprints each model's architecture and weights and reports a genotype — a single, at-a-glance label describing how original (or derived) the model is. Every value is measured from public artifacts, so the results are reproducible and vendor-neutral. This is a transparency tool, not an accusation: building on open-weight foundations (Qwen, Llama, DeepSeek, Mistral) is a standard and legitimate engineering practice across the industry."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/mayafree/Model-Genome-Korea/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"39c3558a3b2226479d21c5e1333e1b303128ee843041c9312ab363c2d145c9c3","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T06:43:39.188Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T06:43:39.188Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Model Genome Korea is a free, interactive tool that reveals the architectural lineage (\"DNA\") of every major Korean sovereign AI foundation model. It genotypes each Korean large language model (LLM) and vision-language model (VLM) — measured directly from public config.json files and model weights on Hugging Face — to show, objectively, which Korean AI models are built from scratch and which are derived from foreign open-weight bases like Qwen, Llama, or DeepSeek.","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/mayafree/Model-Genome-Korea/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"39c3558a3b2226479d21c5e1333e1b303128ee843041c9312ab363c2d145c9c3","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/mayafree/Model-Genome-Korea/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T06:43:39.188Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-10T08:53:48.000Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/mayafree/Model-Genome-Korea/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T06:43:39.188Z","hash":"39c3558a3b2226479d21c5e1333e1b303128ee843041c9312ab363c2d145c9c3","originalBytes":8731,"storedBytes":8731,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["model","korean","architecture","models","skt","attention","foreign","ncsoft","upstage","weights","motif","aether","exaone","foundation","genom